5618: # and the like) without the host markers: $Make builds a fresh ProcessStartInfo; its block is
5619: # scrubbed (Remove-HostMarkersFromStartInfo); when that fails the probe starts from a FRESH start
5620: # info while the markers are hidden from this process (Invoke-WithoutHostMarkers); when that fails
5621: # too the probe is SKIPPED. { Proc ($null when skipped); Skipped ('' or why); Note ('' or how it was
5622: # started instead) }. Start errors throw, as [Process]::Start does.
5623: $script:ProbeWarnings = New-Object System.Collections.Generic.List[string]
5624: function Start-ProbeProcess {
5625:     param([scriptblock]$Make)
5626:     $r = [pscustomobject]@{ Proc = $null; Skipped = ''; Note = '' }

1689: # every other engine). Right before the start the engine's launch invariant is read afresh
1690: # (Get-EngineLaunchBlock -Fresh, D4 - muse: the billing guard re-reads auth.json and the
1691: # environment, never a sign-in cached by the preflight minutes earlier) and, for an engine other
1692: # than codex, the %-hazard of a .cmd launcher (F02-14); a refusal starts nothing. { Proc ($null
1693: # when nothing was started); Refusal ('' or why the launch was refused); Error ('' or why
1694: # Start-Process failed) }. Reads the run's $engineName and $repoRoot.
1695: function Start-EngineProcess {
